INT. STARSHIP BRIDGE - NIGHT

Red alarm lights flash. CAPTAIN REYES (40s), a stern woman in a silver uniform, grips her chair.

ZED, a small robot with blue lights, rolls to the console.

ZED
Shields at ten percent, Captain.

REYES
Fire everything we have!

An explosion shakes the bridge. Sparks rain from the ceiling. Reyes falls to the floor.

ZED
Captain!

Zed helps her up. Reyes looks at the viewscreen.

REYES
(whispering)
Not today.

She pushes a red button. A blinding flash of white light.

INT. STARSHIP BRIDGE - LATER

Silence. Smoke drifts. Reyes and Zed stand together, exhausted.

ZED
We won?

REYES
We survived. That's enough.
